  "problem": "The joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $f$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=2$ | $0.2$ | $0.1$ |\n| $X=4$ | $0.2$ | $0.2$ |\n| $X=6$ | $0.2$ | $0.1$ |\n\nIf $\\text{E}[X]=4$ and $\\text{E}[Y]=1.4,$ calculate the covariance of $X$ and $Y.$",
